      "mergedPostDetails": "**Steps to reproduce:**\n\n1. Wear an avatar without a humanoid rig.\n\n2. Switch to another avatar.\n\n**Actual result:** \n\nThe body of the previous non-humanoid avatar remains and stacks onto your newly equipped avatar locally\n\n**Expected result:**\n\nThe previous avatar disappears and you switch into the new avatar as normal.\n\n**Note:**\n\n- Not only does this only show locally, it only seems to show through the first-person camera and some world cameras.\n\n- This also seems to break the animations of your avatar when looking through a mirror? Haven't investigated that part of it thoroughly.",
